ncm-rs is an independent in-progress Rust port of Next-Concept Modeling (NCM).

Upstream: https://github.com/HazyResearch/ncm
Research reference: c70274273f489abc73832b2b98584a8483b6b203
Paper: https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.14162

Upstream code is MIT licensed:
Copyright (c) 2025 hermann kumbong
The complete upstream license is retained in licenses/NCM-MIT.txt for
translated/derived implementations, including the Sudoku tokenizer and operator
semantics. Required upstream notices must be preserved.

This repository does not bundle upstream weights or evaluation datasets.
Model, tokenizer and dataset licensing must be checked separately before
redistributing artifacts. Referencing MLX, CUDA or Candle does not imply they
are already integrated, validated, or covered by this project's MIT license.
